    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/863580/extras/ad1400acf07accfbbedb62bd03f75147.avif?t=1667825083\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are you ready to be a Viking?</h2><br>How long can you survive the Viking Days? The ultimate Viking simulator trains you until your beard can reach the floor. Be challenged by every day normal situations of a Viking! Inspired by games such as WarioWare and Job Simulator, interact with the environment and be a REAL VIKING!<br><br><strong>10 ULTRA REALISTIC VIKING DAYS!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Forge Swords<br></li><li>Drink Beer<br></li><li>Target Practice<br></li><li>Defend from Arrows<br></li><li>Run from Giants<br></li><li>Face the Dragon<br></li><li>Cross Bridges<br></li><li>Sharp the Axe<br></li><li>Keep the Rythym<br></li><li>Burn Ships</li></ul><br><br>*More mini-games to be added<br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
